    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/aop/framework/ProxyFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.aop.framework\"><code>ProxyFactory</code></a> to create a proxy for <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/PersistentProperty.html#getType()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty.getType()</code></a> to resolve a reference lazily.\n<strong>NOTE:</strong> This class is intended for internal usage only.",
