      "translation": "已准备的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/aop/framework/ProxyFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.aop.framework\"><code>ProxyFactory</code></a>。",
